Halfwin includes code adapted from Rectangle (https://github.com/rxhanson/Rectangle),
used under the MIT License:

Rectangle's drag-to-edge snapping design and geometry — its snap-zone margins and
corner sizes, half/quarter/third/two-thirds frame math, the left/right and bottom-edge
compound snap areas, the footprint preview window, and its Accessibility-API window
lookup and frame read/write — were read and adapted (not copied verbatim) into
Sources/Halfwin/Snapping/. Rectangle's own license text follows:

